WEBVTT

00:02.600 --> 00:06.676
Harness-Field changes the question. Not what did the agent

00:06.776 --> 00:09.772
do, but why is this action the natural next

00:09.872 --> 00:12.580
step in the field it is moving through.

00:15.083 --> 00:19.567
A harness field decomposes into five generalized forces.

00:19.683 --> 00:22.631
Directional force pushes toward the goal.

00:22.733 --> 00:25.537
Affordance makes good actions easier.

00:25.650 --> 00:28.262
Feedback corrects after the action.

00:28.366 --> 00:31.434
Memory lets history shape future motion.

00:31.550 --> 00:33.730
Constraint blocks bad action.

00:34.633 --> 00:37.053
The field shapes the trajectory.

00:40.466 --> 00:44.175
The line that carries the page. A missing test is a

00:44.275 --> 00:49.030
force too, because it removes resistance from a wrong trajectory.

00:49.133 --> 00:54.385
Force is not only what pushes. Force is also what fails to resist.
